Tekst by: ['html'] dwaan: { <- (
		sels
		ferfange: ['&'] troch: ['&amp;'],
		ferfange: ['<'] troch: ['&lt;'],
		ferfange: ['>'] troch: ['&gt;'],
		ferfange: ['"'] troch: ['&quot;']
	).
}.

>> list := Rige nĳ.

['Verbatim Syntax'] karakters elk: { :getal :letterteken
	list ; ((['<li>#Number:Letter</li>']) Number: (getal), Letter: letterteken).
}.

Utfier list.





>> mal := ['
<html>
<body>
<p>Hello this is a test!</p>
<p>The string \‘Verbatim Syntax\’ has: 15 code points...</p>
<ul>
[list]
</ul>
</body> 
</html>
'] [list]: (list gearfoegje: ['↵']).

Utfier skriuwe: mal.

